WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.208
What happens when 800 of the world’s most elite footballers

00:00:03.208 --> 00:00:06.083
and their managers compete in one musical variety show?

00:00:06.083 --> 00:00:09.541
Welcome to a very special episode of the Champions...

00:00:09.541 --> 00:00:12.541
UEFAVISION!

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:15.666
I am your host, Sergio Ramos.

00:00:15.666 --> 00:00:17.708
Let's get started with our first act!

00:00:17.708 --> 00:00:21.625
Since Real won last year, I've been forced to host the UEFAvision.

00:00:21.625 --> 00:00:23.541
OK, so why you and not one of your teammates?

00:00:23.541 --> 00:00:25.375
You don't want me here? Pay me, I'll leave.

00:00:29.583 --> 00:00:30.416
We are Messi.

00:00:30.416 --> 00:00:31.708
We are Messi.

00:00:31.708 --> 00:00:33.083
It is our fate.

00:00:33.083 --> 00:00:34.541
It is our fate.

00:00:34.541 --> 00:00:39.333
When we're not blowing three-goal leads, we are great.

00:00:39.333 --> 00:00:41.833
Oh, we are Messi.

00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:44.666
It's time to show.

00:00:44.666 --> 00:00:49.375
That we are so much better than Cristiano.

00:00:49.375 --> 00:00:50.791
Sucks!

00:00:50.791 --> 00:00:53.333
LADIES AND GENTLEMEN, MY WIFE SHAKIRA.

00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:56.791
[yodeling]

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Fútbol.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:03.166
Game 1 we made Spurs look like a joke.

00:01:03.166 --> 00:01:05.208
But there's two games in a tie.

00:01:05.208 --> 00:01:07.500
And you'd best believe, the second we—

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:08.541
CHOKED!

00:01:08.541 --> 00:01:11.416
Now it's transfer time. We goin' Dutch.

00:01:11.416 --> 00:01:14.916
So, how was Ajax? I skipped the second half.

00:01:14.916 --> 00:01:30.166
In Porto!

00:01:30.166 --> 00:01:33.125
Wow. Pepe. Uh, who would have guessed?

00:01:33.125 --> 00:01:35.458
So I was sort of hoping that since I'm leaving,

00:01:35.458 --> 00:01:37.666
I wouldn't have to join Dortmund on stage.

00:01:37.666 --> 00:01:41.416
Let's just say the German performances can get...pretty out there.

00:01:41.416 --> 00:01:43.958
You like our Yellow Wall?

00:01:43.958 --> 00:01:47.375
Now face our wall of noise...

00:01:47.375 --> 00:01:50.458
WALL OF NOISE!

00:01:50.458 --> 00:01:53.041
Man, I miss those guys.

00:01:53.041 --> 00:01:57.250
Schalke null vier. Schalke no fear.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:00.666
Wir sind die Knappen.

00:02:05.083 --> 00:02:15.083
Take me...take me back to the finals of the Champions League!

00:02:15.083 --> 00:02:18.250
Next up, Atletico, the poor man's Madrid.

00:02:19.583 --> 00:02:24.083
Singing for us will be my best friend, DRAKE!

00:02:24.666 --> 00:02:28.208
A girl up in my DMs, I think I'm gonna block her.

00:02:28.208 --> 00:02:31.500
I can't talk, honey. I'm out here watching soccer.

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:34.750
They want to go to club, but I can't. God forbid.

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:37.708
Cuz Lord knows I'm a big supporter of—

00:02:37.708 --> 00:02:39.333
Atletico Madrid.

00:02:39.375 --> 00:02:41.958
Wait. Atletico's out?! Who's in?

00:02:41.958 --> 00:02:43.208
Uh, Liverpool.

00:02:43.208 --> 00:02:44.750
So, yeah, growing up in Canada

00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:46.416
I've always been a huge fan of Liverpool.

00:02:50.125 --> 00:02:53.916
And that was PSG demonstrating why teamwork is important. 

00:02:53.916 --> 00:02:57.458
And now for something completely different: too many English teams.

00:03:01.833 --> 00:03:03.875
That's the same crap they played last year.

00:03:03.875 --> 00:03:05.833
Why do they think they have a chance this time?

00:03:08.666 --> 00:03:10.750
Oh, he's good, yeah.

00:03:14.166 --> 00:03:15.583
Yeah!

00:03:17.375 --> 00:03:20.666
So Manchester's Blue.

00:03:22.666 --> 00:03:25.625
So glad we're not Man U.

00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:33.791
Funny how Alexis forgot how to score.

00:03:33.791 --> 00:03:36.958
They didn't make top four.

00:03:36.958 --> 00:03:40.333
Wait, so he can sing in English, but he only speaks Spanish?

00:03:40.333 --> 00:03:41.375
I don't get it.

00:03:42.041 --> 00:03:46.833
I might be just one man. But together, we're one man United!

00:03:46.833 --> 00:03:52.166
Uniiiiiited...now that Jose's gone.

00:03:55.625 --> 00:03:59.708
I came in like a cock-er-el.

00:03:59.708 --> 00:04:00.666
Ahhh!

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:08.958
Oh. Ouch. Ooo. Um. OK, ladies and gentlemen, once again, Shakira!

00:04:08.958 --> 00:04:13.416
I can be a Champion.

